  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The back is made from two overlapping panels rather than one. The upper panel has "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "button-loop"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "button loops"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " along its bottom edge. The lower panel has buttons sewn on to match."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Both back panels are plain "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dc-cover-plain"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "double crochet"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The front panel is also plain dc or can use any textured stitch of your choice. Total yarn around 500 m."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "suppliesCard",
        "attrs": {
          "heading": "Materials",
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "Aran yarn",
              "qty": "500 m"
            },
            {
              "name": "5 mm crochet hook",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Tapestry needle",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Scissors",
              "qty": "1 pair"
            },
            {
              "name": "45 cm cushion pad",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Buttons, 3 cm diameter",
              "qty": "3"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Front panel"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chain 65. Work dc rows until 45 cm."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Back upper panel"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chain 65. Work dc rows until 28 cm. On final row: work to position for first loop, ch 6, sl st back into same st to form "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "button-loop"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "button loop"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Continue, placing 2 more loops evenly spaced. Fasten off."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Back lower panel"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chain 65. Work dc rows until 22 cm. Fasten off. Sew 3 buttons to match loop positions."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Assembly"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Place front and back together (back panels overlap at the centre). Whipstitch all four sides. Fasten buttons through loops to close back."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What to try next"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The boho tassel cushion cover uses the same plain dc panel in a simpler single-piece back."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
